title: "RadLite: Multi-Task LoRA Fine-Tuning of Small Language Models for CPU-Deployable Radiology AI"
authors:
  - family-names: "Gupta"
    given-names: "Pankaj"
    affiliation: "Postgraduate Institute of Medical Education and Research, Chandigarh, India"
  - family-names: "Bose"
